---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AdBanner from '../../components/monetization/AdBanner.astro';
import { 
  Sparkles, 
  Clock, 
  Layers, 
  Award, 
  BookOpen, 
  ArrowRight, 
  Zap, 
  ShieldAlert, 
  FlaskConical, 
  Dna, 
  Activity,
  CheckCircle2
} from 'lucide-react';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Módulo II: Nutrición Cerebral y Micronutrientes | NeuroAtlas"
  description="Los cimientos bioquímicos: sin estos ladrillos, ningún nootrópico funcionará. Vitaminas B, metilación, espectro completo del magnesio y minerales esenciales."
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- 1. HERO -->
    <header class="relative rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low p-6 sm:p-10 overflow-hidden space-y-6">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-16 -mt-16 w-72 h-72 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/40 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400 shadow-emerald-glow">
          <FlaskConical className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          MÓDULO II · NIVEL FUNDACIONAL
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container border border-surface-bright text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">
          <Layers className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400" />
          15 CONCEPTOS
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container border border-surface-bright text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">
          <Award className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-secondary" />
          7 SECCIONES
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container border border-surface-bright text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">
          <Clock className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-primary" />
          3-4 HORAS
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text-primary tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Módulo II: Nutrición Cerebral y Micronutrientes
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-emerald-400 font-medium">
          Los cimientos bioquímicos: sin estos ladrillos, ningún nootrópico funcionará
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed pt-2">
          Guía completa de vitaminas, minerales, lípidos y aminoácidos esenciales para el cerebro. Desde el espectro del magnesio hasta la metilación con vitaminas B.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- AdBanner Superior -->
    <AdBanner slotId="modulo-2-top" format="horizontal" />

    <!-- 2. TABLA / PROPÓSITO -->
    <section class="rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <Sparkles className="w-4 h-4" />
        <span>Bioenergética & Cofactores</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">¿Por qué este módulo existe?</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        Imagina que quieres construir un rascacielos (tu rendimiento cognitivo) pero no tienes acero, cemento ni electricidad (micronutrientes). Da igual cuántos "suplementos mágicos" añadas: el edificio no se sostendrá.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        El cerebro consume el <strong class="text-text-primary">20% de la energía del cuerpo</strong> y requiere una cantidad masiva de cofactores (vitaminas y minerales) para:
      </p>

      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-text-secondary">
        <li class="p-2.5 rounded bg-surface-low border border-surface-bright flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> Fabricar neurotransmisores (dopamina, 5-HT, GABA, ACh)
        </li>
        <li class="p-2.5 rounded bg-surface-low border border-surface-bright flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> Mantener la vaina de mielina de las neuronas
        </li>
        <li class="p-2.5 rounded bg-surface-low border border-surface-bright flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> Producir energía mitocondrial (ATP)
        </li>
        <li class="p-2.5 rounded bg-surface-low border border-surface-bright flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> Reparar ADN y frenar el estrés oxidativo
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-biotech bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-300 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>La regla de oro:</strong> Antes de gastar dinero en racetams, péptidos o psicodélicos, asegúrate de que tu cuerpo tiene los cimientos nutricionales. Este módulo te enseña exactamente qué necesitas, en qué forma química y por qué.
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. MAPA DE CONTENIDO (Secciones 2.1 y 2.3) -->
    <section class="space-y-8">
      <div class="border-b border-surface-bright pb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🗺️ Mapa de Contenido del Módulo II</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-secondary mt-1">
            Monografías exhaustivas de vitaminas, minerales y formas químicas bioactivas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sección 2.1 -->
      <div class="rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-surface-bright pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">2.1</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Sección 2.1 — El Complejo B y la Metilación</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">9 MONOGRAFÍAS</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary italic">El motor de la producción de neurotransmisores y la desintoxicación cerebral.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="/conceptos/introduccion-vitaminas-b-metilacion" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Introducción a las Vitaminas B y Metilación</span>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b1-tiamina" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B1 (Tiamina)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Metabolismo de la glucosa y energía cerebral</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b2-riboflavina" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B2 (Riboflavina)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Cadena de transporte de electrones y migrañas</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b3-niacina" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B3 (Niacina)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">NAD+ y reparación del ADN</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b5-acido-pantotenico" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B5 (Ácido Pantoténico)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Coenzima A y síntesis de acetilcolina</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b6-piridoxina" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B6 (Piridoxina / P-5-P)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Cofactor maestro para dopamina, serotonina y GABA</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b7-biotina" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B7 (Biotina)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Mielina y metabolismo de ácidos grasos</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b9-folato" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B9 (Folato / Metilfolato)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Metilación, ADN y el gen MTHFR</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-b12" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between md:col-span-2">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vitamina B12 (Cobalamina)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Mielinización, energía y las 4 formas químicas</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sección 2.2 -->
      <div class="rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-surface-bright pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">2.2</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Sección 2.2 — Antioxidantes & Cofactores Esenciales</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">EN PROCESO</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary italic">Protección redox neuronal y biosíntesis de catecolaminas.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-c" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-amber-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Vitamina C (Ácido Ascórbico)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Cofactor de catecolaminas y antioxidante cerebral</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-d3-k2" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-amber-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Vitamina D3 y K2 (MK-7)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Neurohormona esteroide y homeostasis vascular</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/vitamina-e-tocoferoles" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-amber-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between md:col-span-2">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Vitamina E (Tocoferoles & Tocotrienoles)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Escudo lipídico contra la peroxidación y protección de PUFAs/mielina</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sección 2.3 -->
      <div class="rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-surface-bright pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/20 text-primary font-mono text-xs font-bold">2.3</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Sección 2.3 — El Espectro Completo del Magnesio</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">6 MONOGRAFÍAS</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary italic">El mineral maestro: 300+ reacciones enzimáticas, incluido el cerebro.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="/conceptos/introduccion-magnesio" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Introducción al Magnesio</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Por qué el 70% de la población es deficiente</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/magnesio-l-treonato" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Magnesio L-Treonato (Magtein)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">El único que cruza la BHE: memoria y aprendizaje</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/magnesio-glicinato" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Magnesio Glicinato</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Calma, ansiedad y sueño profundo</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/magnesio-taurato" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Magnesio Taurato</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Regulación del glutamato y salud cardiovascular</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/magnesio-malato" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Magnesio Malato</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Energía, fatiga crónica y ciclo de Krebs</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/otros-tipos-magnesio" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Otros Tipos de Magnesio</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Orotato, Citrato, Cloruro, Sulfato, Óxido y Aspartato</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sección 2.4 -->
      <div class="rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-surface-bright pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">2.4</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Sección 2.4 — Minerales Traza & Electrolitos</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">EN PROCESO</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary italic">Modulación alostérica sináptica y balance de metaloenzimas.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="/conceptos/zinc" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Zinc (Zn²⁺)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Modulador de la sinapsis glutamatérgica y ratio Zn:Cu</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-cyan-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
          <a href="/conceptos/litio-orotato" class="p-3.5 rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:bg-surface-container transition-all group flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Litio Orotato (Microdosis)</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-text-muted italic">Inhibición de GSK-3β, neurogénesis adulta y BDNF</div>
            </div>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-text-muted group-hover:text-cyan-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0 ml-2" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. GUÍA DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADA -->
    <section class="rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface-low p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <BookOpen className="w-4 h-4" />
        <span>Ruta Pedagógica</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">📋 Guía de Estudio Recomendada</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-2">
        <div class="rounded-biotech border border-surface-bright bg-surface p-5 space-y-3.5">
          <div class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 text-primary font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase">
            Nivel 1
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text-primary">Para el principiante:</h3>
          <ol class="text-xs text-text-secondary space-y-2.5 list-decimal list-inside leading-relaxed">
            <li>Empieza con <strong class="text-text-primary">Introducción al Magnesio</strong> (el mineral más crítico para el cerebro).</li>
